n/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"arybochkin","id":79331145,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MzMxMTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79331145?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin","html_url":"https://github.com/arybochkin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2023-11-13T19:25:59Z","updated_at":"2023-11-28T20:22:22Z","closed_at":"2023-11-20T18:56:57Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-8884](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-8884)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nThis github tracks another case when indexes of empty YCQL tables have incorrect tablet metadata, leading to performance issues as described in #19544 \r\n\r\n**Scenario**: `BackfillTable::AllowCompactionsToGCDeleteMarkers` is failing in case if index creation for the empty table.\r\n\r\n**Steps to reproduce:**\r\n```\r\n1. create table tbl(k int primary key, v int) WITH transactions = { 'enabled' : true };\r\n2. create index tbl_idx on tbl(v) WITH transactions = { 'enabled' : true };\r\n```\r\nThe following log message can be observed:\r\n```\r\nE1106 13:32:57.176299 257064960 backfill_index.cc:1203] Index 76d2697586a04dd89d8f10bbd41ccdea is in state PREPARING : cannot enable compactions on it\r\n```\r\nAnd the subsequent `TabletServiceAdminImpl::BackfillDone()` is never triggered, which mean `retain_delete_markers` is never reset, which lead to the conditions described in https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/19544.\r\nBackfilling works fine if some data has been inserted:\r\n```\r\ncreate table tbl2(k int primary key, v int) WITH transactions = { 'enabled' : true };\r\ninsert into tbl2(k,v) values(1,1);\r\ninsert into tbl2(k,v) values(2,2);\r\ninsert into tbl2(k,v) values(3,3);\r\ncreate index tbl2_idx on tbl2(v) WITH transactions = { 'enabled' : true };\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Note.** The side-effect of the issue is that `retain_delete_markers` is never reset in the sys catalog as the method [exits](https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/blob/39b60d853006549f1391727000514a7e884ccad1/src/yb/master/backfill_index.cc#L1218) before changing the property.\r\n\r\n### Issue Type\r\n\r\nkind/bug\r\n\r\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\r\n\r\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\r\n\r\n[DB-8884]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-8884?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"arybochkin","id":79331145,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MzMxMTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79331145?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin","html_url":"https://github.com/arybochkin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/19933/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/19933/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}